This extension does not collect, transmit, or persist any personal browsing data.

HTML source is processed locally and held briefly in Chrome's memory-backed session storage. It is deleted immediately after the preview reads it and is never synchronized or sent to the extension developer or a third-party preview service.

When the user explicitly enables Allow active content, scripts and absolute HTTPS assets referenced by the previewed HTML may be downloaded from and communicate with third-party servers selected by that HTML.
